        <mxCell id="cABAZdG-4c3w-i0kzepM-1264" value="The region connector is likely misconfigured or unavailable.&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The user will not be able to resolve this. We might want to log that state if it happens in production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=15;" parent="1" vertex="1">
